  <item>
    <title>03.什么，你还没看过短剧？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663b8377df37950503b55a85</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663b8377df37950503b55a85</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 这个男人怎么做到看短剧不充钱的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 从投资人角度看短剧投资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 现金流动起来，就是好生意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 短剧究竟应该算互联网行业还是影视行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> 短剧是失意中年人的精神麻药？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 多巴胺刺激多了，来点清淡的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> 短剧是种内容升级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> 能否卷出一个完全竞争市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 歪嘴龙王邪魅一笑，跳不开的梗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a> 日韩剧有没有可能来借鉴短剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 短剧究竟是谁的蛋糕</span></p><span></span><p><span>--本期话题成员--</span></p><span></span><p><span>兰德</span></p><span></span><p><span>连环屁大王</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkfZzwr3L6vC98bpfS6NCA7vh1zN.m4a" length="60875546" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhy8sktGU44ofXenOTM__njiJ1CD.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
